  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: First stable release. The public API surface is unchanged from 1.0.0-preview.3 (enforced by package baseline validation); SemVer applies from here — PATCH for fixes, MINOR for additive surface, MAJOR for any break. The PostQuantum.Jwt engine dependency moves to its stable 1.0.0. Graduating from preview does NOT add an audit: the underlying cryptographic construction remains not independently audited — at 1.0 that is reframed from a pending gate to a permanent, documented limitation (matching the engine's 1.0.0), because an unfunded project is unlikely to secure a formal review and perpetual preview served no one. Appropriate for controlled issuer/verifier systems where you own both sides and accept that documented risk; see KNOWN-GAPS.md and SECURITY.md. Full notes: https://github.com/systemslibrarian/postquantum-aspnetcore/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md.",
